NASB 1995 (biblehub):
You, O king, are the king of kings, to whom the God of heaven has given the kingdom, the power, the strength and the glory;
2:38	凡世人所住之地的走獸，並天空的飛鳥，他都交付你手，使你掌管這一切。你就是那金頭。	and wherever the sons of men dwell, *or* the beasts of the field, or the birds of the sky, He has given *them* into your hand and has caused you to rule over them all. You are the head of gold.
2:39	在你以後必另興一國，不及於你；又有第三國，就是銅的，必掌管天下。	After you there will arise another kingdom inferior to you, then another third kingdom of bronze, which will rule over all the earth.
